  "tokenizer_truth": "the tokenizer answers 'is this line code', not 'would this module import'; a file with a genuinely unterminated literal stops the stream and is disclosed as stream_ended_early",
  "single_consumer": "only E331 is re-priced.  E326/E328/E329/E330 read the same helper, so their counts are floors of the same shape but are not re-derived here",
  "face_level": "the recovery classifies lines by shape (def / class / path literal / load call / selftest mention); it does not execute them"
 },
